            "caption": "How we choose",
            "heading": "Usable forms, research doses",
            "text": "<p>Chelated minerals, the extract ratios used in the studies, and amounts that match them. If the evidence points to 300 mg, we do not put in 50 mg and list the ingredient anyway.</p>",
